  "notes": "{企画|きかく} refers to planning, projects, or proposals, common in business contexts.\n\nUSAGE:\nUsed with する: {企画|きかく}する (to plan)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {企画|きかく}を{立|た}てる: to make a plan\n- {企画|きかく}を{考|かんが}える: to think up a plan\n- {企画|きかく}が{通|とお}る: a proposal gets approved\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- {企画|きかく}{部|ぶ}: planning department\n- {企画|きかく}{書|しょ}: project proposal/plan document\n- {商品|しょうひん}{企画|きかく}: product planning\n\nNOTE:\nCan refer to both the planning process and the planned project itself.",
